# Local leak-guard: ALL MLB domain data (raw downloads, parquets, odds) stays
# private/untracked. Avoids touching the human-gated root .gitignore (P0-A-001).
# Price-bearing (odds-derived) artifacts + sportsbookreviewsonline.com source data
# -> nothing here goes public. This nested guard is INDEPENDENT of the root
# .gitignore so it remains effective whether or not P0-A-001 has been committed.
*
!.gitignore
